  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e0d8dd5b8f33e34b965fec3f1ff8d3e, type: 3}
  m_Name: L1110_GoingThroughWalls
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  exerciseNumber: 10
  exerciseName: GoingThroughWalls
  exerciseTitle: Going through walls
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458668
  exerciseText: Player is going through walls
  hintText: Are the components all 2D? Is the Rigidbody setup correctly?
  solutionText: The Rigidbody2D is set up as a Kinematic Rigidbody, meaning the Physics
    system cannot apply forces to it which means it ends up going inside walls. Swap
    to Dynamic and collisions will work.
